=== H1: Inner subquery with JOIN (unsupported) ===
H1 response:
subquery with JOIN is not supported

=== H2: Inner subquery without correlation (unsupported) ===
H2 response:
must have a WHERE clause with correlation

=== H3: Inner subquery with GROUP BY (unsupported) ===
H3 response:
must not have GROUP BY

=== H4: Inner subquery with non-aggregate output (unsupported) ===
H4 response:
output must be an aggregate function

=== H5: Outer query with GROUP BY + subqueries (unsupported) ===
H5 response:
GROUP BY are not yet supported

